[0.084, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[29AI have added \u001b[94ma2ui_core\u001b[m, \u001b[94ma2ui_agent\u001b[m, and \u001b[94ma2ui_flutter\u001b[m to the project and integrated A2UI v1.0 \u001b[94m<a2ui-json>\u001b[m surface\r\n  streaming and rendering into the chat UI:\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\n  \u001b[1m### Summary of Changes\u001b[m\r\n\u001b[K\n  1. \u001b[1mDependencies (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jkef2e58f11407fcdc;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/pubspec.yaml\u0007p\u001b[22mubspec.yaml\u001b[39;24;1m\u001b]8;;\u0007)\u001b[m\r\n      \u2022 Added \u001b[94ma2ui_core: ^0.5.0\u001b[m, \u001b[94ma2ui_agent: ^0.1.0\u001b[m, and \u001b[94ma2ui_flutter: ^0.1.0\u001b[m.\r\n  2. \u001b[1mA2UI v1.0 Catalog, Prompt Negotiation & Starter Surface (\u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk78c208d231f62e8c;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart\u0007c\u001b[22mhat_repository.dart\u001b[39;24;1m\u001b]8;;\u0007)\u001b[m\r\n      \u2022 Configured \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk4fca0277716f079c;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repositories/chat_repository.dart#L103\u0007ChatRepository.defaultA2uiCatalog\u001b[m\u001b]8;;\u0007 (\u001b[94mbasicCatalog()\u001b[m), \u001b[34;4m\u001b]8;id=jk8419e45809cfee3f;file:///Users/brett/tmp/agy_genui_demo/lib/data/repo"]
